Design Patterns YOU ARE USING
Gacha → Strategy + State
Different banners = different logic
Weather → Strategy Pattern
interface WeatherEffect { void applyEffect(Player player); } 
Trade → Transaction Script
Controlled, validated execution
Anipals → Inheritance + Polymorphism
abstract class Anipal { abstract void performTask(); } 

EDGE CASES
Player disconnect during trade
Double confirmation spam
Gacha pity overflow
Raid abuse (cooldowns)
Weather sync across players

TESTING STRATEGY
Test:
Gacha probabilities + pity
Trade validation
Weather effects
Raid calculations

